# --- Windows System Files ---
# These are junk files Windows creates in your folder
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Private Data ---
# This prevents your 1 Lakh row Excel/CSV files from being public
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.ods

# --- Source Code Protection ---
# This ensures only the SCRAMBLED code goes to GitHub.
# It ignores any file with "backup" or "original" in the name.
*backup*
*original*
*clean*
readable_version.html

# --- Antivirus & Logs ---
# For your Quick Heal logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp

# --- IDE/Editor Files ---
# If you use VS Code or Notepad++ backups
.vscode/
.idea/
*.bak
